      "text": "W2D4 不是孤立的一天，它是 Week 2 真正开始“做应用”的起点。",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "W2D4 不是孤立的一天，它是 Week 2 真正开始“做应用”的起点。",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text-9ygcn5t8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
